From bef6b18aeb4a385c8a8ff3db61dcced82c79cdfa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan <kloterstefan@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 06:19:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/20] Vizzbox 1.1: the VIZZBOX's pages KLANG and MOD, the
 focus track, its keys, the layers, the buses

BRIEF-VIZZBOX-1.1.md 3: the VIZZBOX becomes a switch in front of Skiff's own interface (ui_vizzbox.c vb_input
takes its buttons and SONG's knobs, Skiff's ui_input does the rest). EDIT KLANG, LFO MOD, the same button again
SONG, HOME tapped SONG: Skiff's pages for the focus track with their cards and graphs; KLANG from LIVE (the
role's four: the engine's two HOME tone knobs, RELEASE or its own decay, DIST), then EDIT's, ENV's, FX's pages
and the MIXER, MOD LFO's; SELECT through them (a sheet's rows first), PRESETS the role's sounds by Skiff's LIST
types (the style's first, marked *), HOME + PRESETS every sound. The focus track is the selected one: the LEAD at
power-on, ALGORITHM on KLANG and MOD, SEL + a black key everywhere; SONG frames it and marks a track the user
took. The white keys play it: DRUMS a lane a key, CHORDS a chord a key, the rest in the song's scale; the black
keys never a note (producer_isr.c vb_key). FX, ARP, GLO: Skiff's layers, tapped DROP NOW / BREAK NOW (on the
release), held the FX layer, PERFORM (its throws; the keys play, no lists), GLO the buses (BUSES, then DELAY,
REVERB, CHORUS on SELECT) with the favourites; LFO held + a knob MOMENTARY; HOME held its map (the VIZZBOX's
combos); HOME long the MENU (1.0 never opened it there). LEDs: the page, the layer held, the focus track's key
breathing. The tracks are the producer's from PLAY or KLANG / MOD on, never before (the songs of 1.0 stay bit for
bit: taking them at power-on moved an engine switch, so the audio). Leaving the VIZZBOX stopped gives the
GROOVEBOX back its page and track.

tests/producer_test.c: pages, browse, keys, layers, momentary; tests/vizzbox_ui.c: KLANG, MOD, the layers, HOME's
map in every palette (the focus frame changes 1.0's SONG screens: intended); tests/vizzbox_inactive.c starts the
unit in the GROOVEBOX as one switched there (it was forced after a VIZZBOX start); tests/vizzbox_mutants.py four
faults more.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R1rawochSWXFaES57pjc4r
